{1020}{}{Stupid?}
{2000}{}{You'd better watch yourself here.@@Behave, and we won't have to get nasty.@@You're OK.@@Nice day, isn't it?@@We are from Junktown. Nice place to live, as long as you stay on our good side.@@Keep out of trouble.}
