{2020}{}{Bye.}
{3000}{}{You'd better watch yourself here.@@This isn't a good town to get in trouble in.@@Behave, and we won't have to get nasty.@@You're OK.@@Nice day, isn't it?@@We come from Junktown. Nice place to live, as long as you stay on our good side.@@Keep out of trouble.}
